-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",117,{
[3713]="700078FA\n1\tBring padded gloves to Geoffrey Fuller\030Collect padded gloves\tGeoffrey Fuller is in the village of Combe. Geoffrey is sick to death of the splinters he encounters every day during his work at the lumber-camp and has asked if you can bring him some padded gloves. A tailor should be able to make the gloves.\n",
[3714]="7000786F\n1\tBring minor battle-lore and minor weaponsmithing-lore to Clayton Cole\030Collect minor battle-lore\030Collect minor weaponsmithing-lore\tClayton Cole is by the Combe-gate on the east side of the town of Bree. Clayton has asked you to find a scholar who can provide you with minor weaponsmithing-lore and minor battle-lore.\n",
[3715]="70007332\n1\tBring rowan bowstaves to Laegon\030Collect rowan bowstaff (total: 3)\tLaegon is at Celondim, in Ered Luin. Laegon has asked if you could bring him three rowan bowstaves he can use to refine his bow-bending techniques.\n",
[3716]="70007F20\n1\tBring bronze leggings to Gagi Cloudbrow\030Collect bronze leggings\tGagi Cloudbrow is west of Frerin's Court. Gagi Cloudbrow has asked you to procure for him some bronze leggings, because the pair he tried to make for himself turned out poorly, and in no way resembled the leggings for which he was trying.\n",
[3717]="70007FBD\n1\tBring minor woodworking and metalsmithing-lore to Solvi Scrollbearer\030Collect minor metalsmithing-lore\030Collect minor woodworking-lore\tSolvi Scrollbearer is at Gondamon, on the low-lands of Ered Luin. Solvi Scrollbearer asked you to have a scholar prepare some minor metalsmithing-lore and some minor woodworking-lore for him to examine.\n",
[3718]="70007342\n1\tTalk to Emerald Borings\tEmerald Borings is at the Michel Delving Craft-fair, south-west of the statue in the town centre, past the stables, and along the first leftward turning. Alf Goodcliff suggested you speak with his friend Emerald Borings if you are interested in pursuing a crafting profession.\n",
[3719]="7000737C\n1\tBring minor tailoring-lore to Marigold Twospade\030Collect minor tailoring-lore\tMarigold Twospade is in Michel Delving. Marigold asked you to bring her some minor tailoring-lore so she can get a start on learning the trade, even though no one will teach her.\n",
[3720]="700074B6\n1\tBring mushroom pies to Odo Mudbottom\030Collect mushroom pie (total: 2)\tOdo Mudbottom is in Frogmorton. Odo refuses to eat at The Floating Log while the repairs on the roof are underway, but he still wants his customary mushroom pies.\n",
[3721]="70007397\n1\tBring pie crust to Ned Diggins\030Collect pie crust\tNed Diggins is in Michel Delving. Ned Diggins is waiting for you to return with a pie crust he can use to replace the one he ate that was to replace the one he ate, before his wife discovers it missing.\n",
[3722]="70007F0D\n1\tBring glittering copper necklace to Nefi Gemcutter\030Collect a glittering copper necklace\tNefi Gemcutter is along the road that approaches Thorin's Hall. Nefi Gemcutter has asked you to bring him a glittering copper necklace to replace one he made during his own time as a jeweller.\n",
[3723]="70007FC6\n1\tBring bronze gloves and a bronze helmet to Efi Plateshaper\030Collect bronze gloves\030Collect bronze helm\tEfi Plateshaper is at Gondamon, in the Low-lands of Ered Luin. Efi Plateshaper asked you to bring him bronze gloves and a bronze helm with which he can outfit the defenders of the barricade at Rath Teraig.\n",
[3724]="70007841\n1\tBring eggs and onions and hard biscuits to Seward Proudfoot\030Collect eggs and onions (total: 5)\030Collect hard biscuits (total: 5)\tSeward Proudfoot is outside The Prancing Pony, in the town of Bree. Seward Proudfoot promised some guards he would cook them a breakfast of eggs and onions and hard biscuits, but can't find his recipe-book. He has asked you to find a cook willing to prepare the food and will pay you for the trouble if you bring it to him.\n",
[3725]="70007FC7\n1\tBring roast pork and hard biscuits to Ingi Steambeard\030Collect roast pork (total: 2)\030Collect hard biscuits (total: 2)\tIngi Steambeard is at Gondamon, in the Low-lands of Ered Luin. Ingi Steambeard is hungry and wants you to bring him two servings of roast pork and two hard biscuits with which to feed his appetite.\n",
[3726]="700000C5\n1\tBring bronze blades and bronze hilts to Gríss Stonesmasher\030Collect bronze blades (total: 2)\030Collect bronze hilts (total: 2)\tGríss Stonesmasher is in the Forging Hall inside Thorin's Hall. Gríss Stonesmasher asked you to bring him two bronze blades and two bronze hilts for him to use as examples for some of his weaponsmithy pupils.\n",
[3727]="700078F7\n1\tTalk to Roderick Carver\tRoderick Carver is by the Craft Hall in Combe, south of Archet. The left path from the Combe town centre climbs up the hill past the Craft Hall. Edward Carver wants you to speak to his brother Roderick about taking up a crafting profession.\n",
[3728]="70007331\n1\tBring minor woodworking-lore to Raindis\030Collect minor woodworking-lore\tRaindis is at Celondim, in Ered Luin. Raindis has asked if you would collect some minor woodworking-lore from a scholar so she can see if any improvements might be made to the wood that is used as the timber for the White Ships.\n",
[3729]="700079A8\n1\tBring a rowan hammer and three rowan hafts to Ember Hayes\030Collect rowan hammer\030Collect rowan haft (total: 3)\tEmber Hayes is at the Combe lumber-camp. Ember has said she would pay you for a rowan hammer and three rowan hafts, if you could bring them to her. A woodworker should be able to make these items.\n",
[3730]="70007396\n1\tBring pie crust to Ned Diggins\030Collect pie crust\tNed Diggins is in Michel Delving. Ned Diggins is waiting for you to return with a pie crust he can use to replace the one he ate, before his wife discovers it missing.\n",
[3731]="700000BD\n1\tTalk to Egil Oldbeard\tEgil Oldbeard is in the Maker's Hall, inside Thorin's Hall, east of the entrance chamber. Bogi Deepdelver suggested that you speak with his friend Egil Oldbeard, who has greeted fledgling crafters in the Blue Mountains for more than one hundred years.\n",
[3732]="7001EFF6\n1\tCollect iron ingots (total: 15)\030Collect burnished worm-scales (total: 10)\tIron ingots and burnished worm-scales can be collected from the Orcs and worms inhabiting the Flaming Deeps. Myndil has asked you to collect black iron and burnished worm-scales for him.\n2\tTalk to Myndil at Anazârmekhem\tMyndil is at Anazârmekhem in the Flaming Deeps of Moria. You should bring the iron and scales you collected to Myndil at once.\n",
[3733]="700077D2\n1\tBring glittering copper ring to Verity Tyne\030Collect glittering copper ring\tVerity Tyne is in the Crafting Hall in Bree. Verity Tyne has asked for you to find a jeweller willing to make her a glittering copper ring to replace the wedding ring she lost.\n",
[3734]="700078B3\n1\tBring a bronze axe and two bronze blades to Leighton Howard\030Collect bronze axe\030Collect bronze blades (total: 2)\tLeighton Howard is in the town of Combe, in Bree-land. Leighton has asked you to obtain a bronze axe and two bronze blades for him, because the local weaponsmiths are charging too much for him to pay, and he needs them to protect his family.\n",
[3735]="7004E931\n1\tCollect valuable trinkets\tCollect valuable trinkets.\n2\tYou should search Stormwall for any valuable trinkets.\t\n3\tBring Hórin the trinkets\tYou should bring the various trinkets to Hórin in Skarháld.\n",
[3736]="7000D3C9\n1\tComplete Torquil's tasks\030Complete Raith's tasks\030Complete Osbail's tasks\tTorquil, Raith, and Osbail are near the ruling seat of Crannog, the chieftain of Aughaire. Crannog has tasked you with facing the dangers of which Torquil, Raith, and Osbail will speak. Once you have done so, he expects you to return to him.\n2\tTalk to Crannog\tCrannog is at his ruling seat in Aughaire, west of the centre island. You have aided some of the Trév Gállorg with the dangers faced by the settlement and should now tell Crannog of your successes.\n",
[3737]="7000D3C7\n1\tChallenge Nekhtan\tNekhtan goes to train at a great tree east of Aughaire. Crannog told you to leave the settlement by the north, and to then turn east and follow the line of the hills until you see the tree in a basin to the north. Crannog told you the story of Nekhtan, the greatest warrior of the Trév Gállorg, whose father was slain in the last Clúcath, where the Trév Duvárdain listened to their Angmarim masters and violated the rules of the rite. You are tasked with defeating him for the right to represent the Trév Gállorg at Clúcath.\n2\tTalk to Crannog\tCrannog is at his ruling-seat, west of the central island in the settlement of Aughaire. You have defeated Nekhtan and should bring word of your success to Crannog.\n",
[3738]="7000D3CA\n1\tDefeat Feradakh\030Defeat Fonghala\030Defeat Moridac\tRaith is near Crannog's ruling seat, west of the centre island of Aughaire. Feradakh is at the Búth Luikh, south-east of Crannog's ruling-seat. Fonghala is at the Búth Sánkhas, south-east of the market of Aughaire. Moridac is at the aurochs-pens in Aughaire, north-east of Crannog's ruling-seat. In an effort to see if you are strong enough to represent the Trév Gállorg in the upcoming Clúcath, Crannog has tasked you with fighting several of Aughaire's mightiest warriors. Raith can tell you about each of them.\n2\tTalk to Crannog\tCrannog is at his ruling-seat, west of Aughaire's centre island. You have defeated the three warriors set before you by Crannog and should tell him now of your victories.\n",
[3739]="7000D3CB\n1\tComplete Lakhina's tasks\030Complete Camran's tasks\030Complete Rona's tasks\tLakhina, Camran, and Rona are at the centre island of Aughaire, east of Crannog's ruling seat. Crannog wants you to speak with Lakhina, Camran, and Rona of Aughaire and perform the tasks they ask of you.\n2\tTalk to Crannog\tCrannog is at his ruling-seat in Aughaire, west of the centre island. You have performed the tasks given you by Lakhina, Camran, and Rona and should now return to Crannog.\n",
[3740]="7000D3CC\n1\tTalk to Raith\tRaith is standing by Crannog's ruling-seat, in Aughaire, west of the settlement's central island. Crannog has granted you your Fém -- to begin the rite of the Clúcath -- and told you to speak with Raith to learn what this involves.\n2\tCollect Stone of Clúcath\tThe Cairn of Honour is north-east of Fail-á-Khro, far to the north of Aughaire. The hilltop on which the Cairn of Honour rests is marked by a line of torches. Raith has told you that you must collect the Stone of Clúcath and bring it to Crannog.\n3\tBring Stone of Clúcath to Crannog\tCrannog is at his ruling-seat, west of the centre island of Aughaire. You have taken the Stone of Clúcath from the Cairn of Honour and should bring it now to Crannog.\n",
[3741]="700461B9\n1\tRecover crashed kites (total: 6)\tCrashed kites can be found throughout Hobbiton. You should collect the crashed kites so that other festival patrons may enjoy them.\n2\tBring the crashed kites to Lila Roper\tLila Roper can be found at the party tree in Hobbiton. You should bring Lila Roper the crashed kites.\n",
[3742]="700154CC\n1\tDamage the decayed columns (total: 6)\tThe decaying columns can be found in the Orc-camps at Fehem-dûm and Hadâd-dûm, east of Jazârgund. Hamall noticed several decaying columns within the nearby Orc-camps. He assures you if they are damaged enough, everything will come crashing down and destroy the camps.\n2\tTalk to Hamall at Jazârgund\tHamall is at Jazârgund, west of Fehem-dûm and Hadâd-dûm. Hamall should know that none of the columns collapsed, and the cavern did not collapse.\n",
[3743]="70059437\n1\tCollect empty crates (total: 12)\tEmpty crates can be found throughout Trestlebridge. You should collect all the empty crates.\n2\tDeliver the empty crates to the store house in Trestlebridge\tThe store house can be found in Trestlebridge. You should deliver the empty crates to the store house in Trestlebridge.\n3\tTalk to Cad Buckthorn\tCad Buckthorn can be found in Trestlebridge. You should talk to Cad Buckthorn.\n",
[3744]="70025CA7\n1\tSearch the crates (total: 9)\030Search the barrels (total: 5)\tCrates and barrels are spread around Rantost. Leighton Kipps has asked you to count the packed crates and barrels around Rantost.\n2\tTalk to Leighton Kipps at Rantost\tLeighton Kipps is camped at the south-east corner of Rantost. Leighton Kipps will want to know how many crates and barrels there are so he can relay the information to the Rangers.\n",
})
